  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1771865660_5467967_e120357dd97619356bc36881ce516db1.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">About Our Brand and Products</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">IMBA is a <strong>clean energy</strong> and <strong>cognitive soda</strong> brand designed to deliver sustained energy and mental clarity without a crash. Our formulas is built for focus and combines Green Tea Caffeine with brain-supporting ingredients like L-theanine, Alpha-GPC, Panax ginseng, and B-vitamins.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We do not use artificial sweeteners, artificial colors, or unnecessary additives. Our goal is to provide balanced, functional energy that supports focus, productivity, and performance.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Our flavors include Sour Blue Razz, Sour Lemon Lime, Orange &amp; Cream, Root Beer, and variety packs. Each can is crafted to be both functional and great tasting.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">What Makes Us Different</span></strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Clean, balanced energy</strong><br>IMBA is formulated for steady focus and sustained energy without jitters or crashes. Our ingredient blends are intentionally designed to support cognition and mental performance.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Functional soda format</strong><br>We combine the taste and experience of soda with performance-driven ingredients, creating something that feels familiar but functions better.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Transparent and straightforward</strong><br>We clearly communicate what is in our products and why it is included. No hidden blends. No gimmicks.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;float:none;\"><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates earn a 10% commission on all approved sales.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Commissions are approved after the return period has passed. Payouts are processed monthly once an affiliate reaches the minimum payout threshold.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Sales must be completed and paid to qualify. Refunded or canceled orders do not count toward commission.</p><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">How to Promote Us</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Create authentic content<br></strong>Share your personal experience using IMBA in your daily routine, workouts, study sessions, gaming sessions, or workdays.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Post on social platforms<br></strong>Promote through Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, or other platforms using your unique affiliate link or discount code.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Write reviews or blog posts<br></strong>Create detailed reviews that explain the benefits, ingredients, and flavor experience.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Share with your community<br></strong>Introduce IMBA to audiences interested in productivity, fitness, gaming, entrepreneurship, or wellness.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Always disclose your affiliate relationship clearly and focus on honest recommendations.</p><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Other Information</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates must be at least 18 years old and provide accurate payment information.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">All promotions must comply with brand guidelines and applicable advertising laws.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">IMBA reserves the right to review commissions and withhold payment in cases of fraud, abuse, or policy violations.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Our brand voice is energetic, honest, and performance driven. We encourage affiliates to match that tone while staying authentic to their own audience.</p></div></div>",
